12. /// local folder (previous default behavior), cloning a remote repository, or initializing a new
13. /// local repository — the latter two are performed synchronously (relative to this dialog) before
14. /// the mapping is saved, so a freshly added mapping is immediately usable by Commit/Pull &amp; Restore.
